meta {
  name: Create User
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/users
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "external_id": "a123456",
    "email": "john.doe@example.com",
    "name": "John Doe",
    "role": "contributor"
  }
}

script:post-response {
  if (res.status === 201) {
    const data = res.body;
    bru.setVar("created_user_id", data.id);
    bru.setVar("created_user_external_id", data.external_id);
  }
}

docs {
  Create a new user with external ID.
  
  **External ID**:
  - Format: Exactly 7 alphanumeric characters (e.g., "a123456")
  - Case-insensitive: Stored and compared as lowercase
  - Unique: Cannot reuse existing external IDs
  - Required: Must be provided
  
  **Roles**:
  - admin
  - contributor
  - viewer
  
  **Response**:
  - id: Internal UUID (for system use only)
  - external_id: Client-provided ID (use in X-User-ID header)
  
  **Auto-saved variables**:
  - created_user_id: Internal UUID
  - created_user_external_id: External ID for API requests
  
  **Use external_id in X-User-ID header for all subsequent requests.**
}
